<section class="section section--page why">
  <div class="content stack">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <h2>Why we ring</h2>
    </header>
    <p class="why__p">Church bells are the Christian call to prayer. For centuries they have called the faithful to Sunday worship, rung the Angelus at morning, noon, and evening, pealed for weddings, and tolled in remembrance.</p>
    <p class="why__p">When a bell falls silent, a congregation loses more than a sound. We exist so that call is heard again.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we fund</span>
      <h2>Bells, organs, glass, and the hands that keep them</h2>
      <p class="lede">Grants support the building, restoration, and preservation of sacred architecture and the elements that give a house of worship its voice and its light. We also fund the training of the artisans this work depends on. Grant amounts are determined case by case.</p>
    </header>
